@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Super Admin" as Admin
boundary "Halaman\nManajemen User" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
participant "Casbin\nRBAC" as RBAC
database "DB Users" as DB

== Lihat Daftar Pengguna ==

Admin -> UI : Buka menu Manajemen User
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/users
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil daftar pengguna
activate DB
DB --> System : Kembalikan daftar pengguna
deactivate DB

System --> UI : 200 OK + data pengguna
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan tabel daftar pengguna
deactivate UI

== Tambah Pengguna Baru & Assign Role ==

Admin -> UI : Input data\n(Nama, Email, Password, Role)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/users
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi format input
System -> DB : Cek duplikasi email
activate DB
DB --> System : Status unik/duplikat
deactivate DB

alt Email Sudah Terdaftar
    System --> UI : Error: Email sudah terdaftar
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Email Unik
    System -> System : Hash password (bcrypt)
    System -> DB : INSERT users
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Kembalikan user_id
    deactivate DB

    System -> RBAC : Assign Role ke User
    activate RBAC
    RBAC -> DB : INSERT casbin_rules
    activate DB
    DB --> RBAC : Berhasil
    deactivate DB
    RBAC --> System : Role di-assign
    deactivate RBAC

    System --> UI : 201 Created
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Pengguna berhasil ditambahkan
    deactivate UI
end

== Ubah Data Pengguna ==

Admin -> UI : Pilih pengguna yang akan diubah
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/users/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data pengguna by ID
activate DB
DB --> System : Kembalikan data pengguna
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data pengguna
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan form edit
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI : Edit data & role, klik Simpan
activate UI
UI -> System : PUT /api/users/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi data baru
alt Data Tidak Valid
    System --> UI : Error: Data tidak valid
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Data Valid
    System -> DB : UPDATE users
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Pembaruan berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System -> RBAC : Perbarui role jika berubah
    activate RBAC
    RBAC -> DB : UPDATE casbin_rules
    activate DB
    DB --> RBAC : Berhasil
    deactivate DB
    RBAC --> System : Role diperbarui
    deactivate RBAC

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Data pengguna diperbarui
    deactivate UI
end

== Hapus Pengguna ==

Admin -> UI : Pilih pengguna untuk dihapus
activate UI
UI -> System : DELETE /api/users/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Cek apakah menghapus\nakun sendiri
alt Menghapus Akun Sendiri
    System --> UI : Error: Tidak bisa menghapus\nakun sendiri
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Bukan Akun Sendiri
    System -> DB : Soft delete user
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System -> RBAC : Cabut semua role & izin
    activate RBAC
    RBAC -> DB : DELETE casbin_rules
    activate DB
    DB --> RBAC : Berhasil
    deactivate DB
    RBAC --> System : Role dicabut
    deactivate RBAC

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Pengguna berhasil dihapus
    deactivate UI
end

== Validasi Hak Akses (RBAC) ==

Admin -> UI : Akses menu tertentu
activate UI
UI -> System : Request + Bearer Token
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Decode token,\nambil user_id & role

System -> RBAC : Enforce(user_id, resource, action)
activate RBAC
RBAC -> DB : Query policy
activate DB
DB --> RBAC : allow/deny
deactivate DB
RBAC --> System : Hasil (true/false)
deactivate RBAC

alt Akses Diizinkan
    System -> DB : Query data yang diminta
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Kembalikan data
    deactivate DB
    System --> UI : 200 OK + data
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Tampilkan halaman
    deactivate UI
else Akses Ditolak
    System --> UI : 403 Forbidden
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Tampilkan "Akses Ditolak"
    deactivate UI
end

note right of Admin
  User memiliki Role (admin/teknisi).
  Casbin mengecek izin setiap aksi.
  Soft delete: ditandai deleted_at.
  Password di-hash dengan bcrypt.
end note

@enduml
